## Introduction

Most hardware project delays, repeated revisions and budget waste are not caused by poor design ideas, but by **fragmented R&D processes**, **inconsistent technical standards**, and **uncontrolled engineering details** during multi-vendor collaboration.

Separate outsourcing of schematic design, PCB layout, signal simulation, SMT assembly, firmware debugging and mass production often leads to compatibility risks, version chaos and unstable delivery quality. For industrial-grade embedded systems, a **full-process closed-loop controllable workflow** is the key to stable project delivery.

**Xi’an Qiyun Zhixun Electronic Technology Co., Ltd.** provides professional end-to-end hardware R&D and manufacturing services. We focus on embedded computing, FPGA real-time audio/video processing, and industrial control hardware customization, delivering reliable solutions from prototype verification, technical iteration to small/medium batch production for industrial automation, IoT, rail transit, and special equipment scenarios.

## Core Technical Capabilities

- **Full In-House Closed-Loop R&D Pipeline**
We independently complete requirement analysis, schematic design, high-precision PCB layout, SI/PI integrity simulation, EMC & thermal optimization, firmware development, system testing and batch delivery. Unified internal technical standards significantly improve first-pass success rate and avoid cross-team docking errors.
