Experienced in 4K/8K real-time video processing, low-latency signal acquisition, multi-channel data acquisition system design and edge-computing hardware customization. All designs are optimized for stability, low power consumption and long-term operation under harsh industrial conditions.
- **Flexible Cooperation Mechanism**
Support **full turn-key delivery** (full-process customization) and **phased technical outsourcing**. Adaptable for prototype development, project upgrading, capacity supplementation and long-term technical co-development.
- **Industrial-Grade Stability & Scalable Production**
Strictly follow industrial design specifications with complete testing, verification and quality control processes. Support fast prototype iteration and stable small-to-medium batch production to ensure consistent batch performance and reliability.

